<title>JORDAN: PRESS DIGEST - Jordan - July 28.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Jordan - July 28.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Jordanian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>AL-RAI</p>
<p>- Six opposition parties lay out terms for taking part in November parliamentary elections.</p>
<p>AD-DUSTOUR</p>
<p>- King Hussein pays condolences to Jordanian pilot Amr Billal who died when he crashed during air show over Belgian coastal resort of Ostend.</p>
<p>AL-ASWAQ</p>
<p>- Israel apologises over treatment of Jordanian diplomat at roadblock.</p>
</text>
